==Description==
The '''Crab Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 11 of the premium [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{BeachBalls|310}} or {{Robux|41}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|1,740}} or {{Robux|605}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|52}} with a total cost of {{Robux|762}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|662}}.

The '''Crab Nametag''' has light red text with a red outline. Multiple crabs appear on the text, moving either to the left or the right. Money bills also fall out of the text.

